B.aoJ=s(["Ba\u011flant\u0131 kurulamad\u0131. Tekrar dener misin?","Couldn't connect. Try again?"],t.s)
B.ao5=s(["Biraz h\u0131zl\u0131 gittik \u2014 birka\xe7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.","That was quick \u2014 try again in a few minutes."],t.s)
B.acA=s(["Bu plan i\xe7in bug\xfcnl\xfck yeterince de\u011fi\u015fiklik yapt\u0131k. Yeni bir plan ba\u015flatabilirsin.","That's enough changes to this plan for today. You can start a new plan."],t.s)
B.aan=s(["Plan hakk\u0131n \u015fu an bitti. Devam etmek i\xe7in Yumy Kredisi ya da Yumy Plus gerekir.","You have no plans left right now. Yumy Credits or Yumy Plus let you continue."],t.s)
B.adR=s(["Yumy plan olu\u015fturma \u015fu an kapal\u0131.","Yumy plan creation is switched off right now."],t.s)
B.apr=s(["Konumuna eri\u015femedim. Bir b\xf6lge se\xe7ebilirsin.","I couldn't get your location. You can pick an area."],t.s)
B.ayW=s(['Yumy bu iste\u011fi h\xe2l\xe2 haz\u0131rl\u0131yor. Birazdan "Tekrar dene"ye dokun; ikinci kez say\u0131lmaz.','Yumy is still preparing this request. Tap "Try again" in a moment; it is not counted twice.'],t.s)
